{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backyard Defenders is a charming tower defense game where you must protect your picnic from waves of hungry insects. Set in a vibrant backyard environment, you'll strategically place and upgrade various defenders to stop the bug invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 Unique Defenders - Each with special abilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Salt Shaker: Area damage in all directions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Bug Zapper: Chain lightning attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Water Sprinkler: Row attacks with pushback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Spider Web: Slows enemies to 25% speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Fly Swatter: High melee damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Water Balloon Launcher: Splash damage and slow effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Gameplay - Place defenders on a 15x7 grid and upgrade them infinitely</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging Enemies - Face ants, mosquitoes, beetles, and grasshoppers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Epic Boss Battles - Defeat 5 unique Bug God bosses with special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Research System - Unlock permanent upgrades between games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful Animations - Enjoy smooth sprite animations for all units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Progressive Difficulty - Enemies scale in health and speed each wave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your picnic, earn sugar currency, and become the ultimate Backyard Defender!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940000?t=1755014792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940000/33c047891904972497fbf776f6b496bdda73042b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755014792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.